# Only the mod's own work goes in this repository: the two loader projects, the tools that made its
# textures and pictures, and the top-level README and LICENSE. Everything else in this folder (other
# mods' sources and jars, backups, logs, previews) stays local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/goety-boss-servants/
!/goety-boss-servants-forge/
!/tools/

# A third-party decompiler, kept local.
/tools/*.jar
